calls made (were open)
  address    #path:id  ->
             shelf.html#proj/poc/model.py:Field.broken_constraint
             The id is the address, as in page.html (page.html#id); the file
             goes before the colon because the shelf's hash is the file. An id
             never starts with /, so path:/pattern/ stays the form for prose
             and this one for the page: no clash. ids: python the qualified
             name; md the slug path of its headings (design/architecture),
             a duplicate gets -2. A pattern is not stable, an id is.
  node rule  details[id] everywhere. The shelf drops "every details". A
             component's own details has no id and is left alone.
  hidden()   stays: it is the dot-folder filter,
             medium/shelf.html:/const hidden =/

